---
const testimonials = [
  {
    quote:
      "The defining thing about Shanthi is that she has the ability and interest to learn about whatever problem you're facing in your business. She's the go-to do-it-all fixer. In many ways, she's like what AI assistants are trying to be: a general capability that can just help you solve whatever problem you're facing.",
    name: "Jay McCarthy",
    title: "Co-Founder & Chief Security Officer, PrimeVault",
  },
  {
    quote:
      "Shanthi's superpower is top-tier competence, a true 1%er and force multiplier. That rare combination of intellectual capability plus relentless follow-through makes her exceptionally effective regardless of the business function she's in. We consistently outperformed companies with 10x–20x more resources than we had.",
    name: "Brandon Rodriguez",
    title: "Head of Growth, Etherfuse",
  },
  {
    quote:
      "Shanthi has a true superpower in crafting thoughtful, high-quality proposals and building company culture. She makes people feel seen and heard, and creates an environment of trust and openness. One of our biggest accomplishments together was generating over $500K in revenue for our developer programs and hosting more than 10 global events.",
    name: "Estefania Ochoa",
    title: "Founder & Head of Growth, Guava Global",
  },
];
---

<section class="section testimonials">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <span class="eyebrow">Testimonials</span>
      <h2>What it's like to work with me</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="testimonials__grid">
      {testimonials.map((t) => (
        <figure class="testimonials__item">
          <blockquote>{t.quote}</blockquote>
          <figcaption>
            <span class="testimonials__name">{t.name}</span>
            <span class="testimonials__title">{t.title}</span>
          </figcaption>
        </figure>
      ))}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .testimonials__grid {
    margin-top: var(--space-4);
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: var(--space-4);
  }

  .testimonials__item {
    margin: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-2);
  }

  .testimonials__item blockquote {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: var(--fs-body);
    line-height: var(--lh-relaxed);
    color: var(--color-ink);
  }

  .testimonials__item blockquote::before {
    content: "\201C";
    color: var(--color-accent-secondary);
  }

  .testimonials__item blockquote::after {
    content: "\201D";
    color: var(--color-accent-secondary);
  }

  .testimonials__item figcaption {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    font-size: var(--fs-small);
    color: var(--color-ink-soft);
  }

  .testimonials__name {
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-ink);
  }

  @media (max-width: 60rem) {
    .testimonials__grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: var(--space-5);
    }
  }
</style>
